            "review_title": "Review at El Vino Wine & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Richard C\n24 contributions\n1\nFabulous Italian style restaurant on the edge of West Lake Hanoi\nOct 2019\nEl Vino has eating facilities on several floors all overlooking West Lake. Decor throughout is classic period. Very comfortable. Service excellent. Food out of this world. Presentation terrific. Good range of wines and beers.\nAssistant General Manager Nguyen Truong Giang is a good host and added to the enjoyment of our visit and dinner.\nRecommended especially for couples or groups who are seeking a pleasant unrushed dining experience in tasteful surroundings.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 13, 2019\nLinh Nguyen\nDear Richard C, \n\nThank you very much for taking the time to share your feedback about El Vino Wine & Restaurant with the Trip Advisor community.\n\nIt is my pleasure to read that you appreciated our genuine service and also the food and wine list. And we would like to thank you for your recognition for the team regarding their great performance.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon.\n\nWith kind regards,\n\nLinh Nguyen, \nSales & Marketing Manager\nRead more\nWritten October 21, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
