            "review_text": "Andy_Kien3711\nHanoi, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nPerfect dinner time\nJun 2019 • Friends\nI went to El Vino with my friends for a dinner time. It was an perfect night with fine foods, wines and warmly atmosphere and beautiful view. We realy ẹnoy conversations with knowlegeable manager and friendly service staffs. We will be back very soon.\nWritten June 5, 2019\nLinh Nguyen\nDear Andy_Kien3711\n\nMany thanks for your positive feedback following your recent visit with us at El Vino Wine & Restaurant and I was delighted to read that you enjoyed your dinner with us and all the service and restaurant atmosphere met your expectations. We would be thrilled to have you soon. \n\nKind regards, \nLinh Nguyen\nSales & Marketing Manager\nRead more\nWritten June 8, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
