            "review_title": "Review at El Vino Wine & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tuan H\n1 contribution\n1\nFabulous food & service\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nWe came for birthday celebrated. We were amazed by the food and services.Nice view roof floor . Staff are very attentive, courteous .Skillet serving creative dishes and truly original. Strongly recommended for special celebration.\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 27, 2019\nLinh Nguyen\nThank you for such a fabulous review. We were absolutely delighted to learn how much you enjoyed your birthday celebration and in particular we are most grateful for your kind words regarding our staff and service levels. \n\nWe are thrilled to learn that our attentive staffs stood out to you especially as delivering outstanding service. We very much hope to see you, your friend and your family on another occasion very soon.\n\nKind regards,\nLinh Nguyen\nSales & Marketing Manager\nRead more\nWritten April 11, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
